  "collectionNotes": [
    "已实现独立ESP32-H2 SRAM客体、RX23/TX24@115200的原生UART双向路径及BOOT9输入。无ROM、Flash-cache执行、USB或无线网关；原厂固件兼容与实物验证仍未知。",
    "Official CAD priority investigated using the complete fixed18de3bb hardware tree and exact-product Structure links. U195 native enclosure retained; other four have no matching CAD in those searched sources.",
    "Model plans retain exact photo SHA-256, crops, perspective matrices, UV planes and all geometry estimates. No static screen image is displayed.",
    "Photograph overlay/three-color browser review and physical hardware measurements remain unverified.",
    "Runtime digital subset and actual guest/negative checks: docs/platform/m5-edge-runtime-20261126.md. These checks do not establish factory firmware compatibility or hardware validation.",
    "Actual batch020 compiled production Worker/WASM checks passed this SKU and its configured negatives; exact guest observations and hashes: docs/platform/evidence/m5-edge-runtime-20261126/worker-020.json. This validates the declared digital subset, not factory firmware or physical hardware."
  ]
